      "call_made": "The second header row (label cell reads \"Procedure\") is recorded as a study-day row named \"Study Day\", although its washout and follow-up entries are a duration (\"3 to 14 days\") and a relative window (\"Within 28±2 days after last study treatment\").",
      "alternative": "Type the row as \"other\" (mixed day / duration / window content), or keep the printed label \"Procedure\" as its name.",
      "report_section": "3"
    },
